// Phase 1 2026-10-14: MF08 assignee/read/evidence/notification require contractor_representative_assignment(user_id,site_id,contractor_id), active role/account/participation. Legacy global grants do not imply Site scope.
// Overview alert/checklist summaries are derived queries, not persisted tables; no new schema/migration in this phase. Alert team context uses dated Zone grants, never verified identity or a work permit.

// Phase 2 Safety Overview: read-only day/week aggregation; source work_date and shift-start membership preserved.
// Checklist first-submission timing and authorized Incident follow-up are derived, not stored as additional columns.
// Recorded is receipt/review, not work permission. Closed Incident retains original FAIL; reopened follow-up needs attention.
// Camera ACTIVE is configuration status. Alert evidence is timestamped, not a live stream. Schema remains 70 tables.
